=== Goal of the Chapter

This chapter integrates and demonstrates the competencies established in chapters 1 to 8 on a realistic AI-enabled system. It serves as the capstone for communicative competence: participants present and defend their AI security architecture and residual-risk assessment to non-technical stakeholders. This exercise forms the primary basis for allocating communicative credit points in this curriculum.

